    Earth helio          5.93e-03 |      0.00e+00   2.49e-16 |      0.00e+00       8.35e-15
    Saturn helio         6.52e-05 |      0.00e+00   2.06e-12 |     3.84e-149       6.91e-11
    Neptune helio        6.56e-06 |     1.44e-113   2.04e-10 |      9.06e-47       6.82e-09
    MICROSCOPE 710km     7.93e+00 |      0.00e+00   1.39e-22 |      0.00e+00       4.67e-21
    lab 1g               9.81e+00 |      0.00e+00   9.10e-23 |      0.00e+00       3.05e-21

